# --- Vendored third-party editor plugin (nested git repo) ---
# Plugins/Claireon is a 3.3 GB checkout of https://github.com/believer-oss/Claireon
# with its own .git and its own history. It is deliberately NOT tracked here: vendoring
# it would balloon this repo's already-24 GB .git, and a submodule cannot carry the local
# AWS SigV4 work (kept on the plugin's own `local/aws-sigv4` branch).
# Re-clone with: git clone https://github.com/believer-oss/Claireon.git Plugins/Claireon
Plugins/Claireon/

# Editor .uproject backups made before plugin toggles
*.uproject.bak_*

# --- Vendored third-party editor plugin (Fab / marketplace install) ---
# Plugins/Oceanology_Plugin is a 13 GB, ~2,950-file Fab install (Binaries/ and Intermediate/
# included) landed 2026-08-27. It is deliberately NOT tracked: vendoring it would add 13 GB to
# an already-24 GB .git, and the .uproject carries its MarketplaceURL so the editor prompts a
# per-machine Fab install instead.
# Re-install from: com.epicgames.launcher://ue/Fab/product/4e59bf12-d0c8-46f4-b5f9-37d48d0b6e63
Plugins/Oceanology_Plugin/
